  "module_docs": [
    "Port of `net.minestom.server.network.packet.server.common.CustomReportDetailsPacket`.",
    "",
    "Java's `STRING.mapValue(STRING, MAX_DETAILS)` writes a `java.util.HashMap`,",
    "whose byte order is not stable between JVM runs; the probe therefore uses a",
    "single-entry map, and the port keeps insertion order (`Vec` of pairs) so a",
    "written map round-trips unchanged."
